      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.74,
          "en": "So let's work on the Add Resource screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.74,
          "end": 8.01,
          "en": "On this screen here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.01,
          "end": 10.35,
          "en": "I in the end, want to have a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.35,
          "end": 13.34,
          "en": "And I'll wrap that form into my good old base card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.34,
          "end": 15.76,
          "en": "to have the card look around the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.76,
          "end": 19.39,
          "en": "And then we can add the form element in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.39,
          "end": 21.55,
          "en": "the native HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.55,
          "end": 25.28,
          "en": "and now add the different input fields which we'll need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.28,
          "end": 30.28,
          "en": "That will be input field for the title of the resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.95,
          "end": 33.6,
          "en": "I also want to give it a label to make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.6,
          "end": 35.41,
          "en": "what the user should enter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.41,
          "end": 37.58,
          "en": "and I'll say Title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.58,
          "end": 40.76,
          "en": "And I'll give the input here, not just a type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.76,
          "end": 45.053,
          "en": "but also an id of title and a name of title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.21,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "And on the label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 51.18,
          "en": "we can add the four attribute and point at title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.18,
          "end": 53.7,
          "en": "to make it a bit more accessible and make it clear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.7,
          "end": 55.223,
          "en": "what we're referring to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.21,
          "end": 58.16,
          "en": "I'll also wrap that all into a div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.16,
          "end": 60.173,
          "en": "which will help me with styling later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.13,
          "end": 65.74,
          "en": "And I'll give this div a class of form-control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.74,
          "end": 68.09,
          "en": "because that is a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.09,
          "end": 70.24,
          "en": "for which I already prepared some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.24,
          "end": 71.68299999999999,
          "en": "which we can soon add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.75,
          "end": 74.6,
          "en": "Now let's copy this entire div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.6,
          "end": 76.72,
          "en": "because we need more than one control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.72,
          "end": 80.77,
          "en": "We also need a control for the description of the resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.77,
          "end": 81.78,
          "en": "And actually there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.78,
          "end": 85.27,
          "en": "I don't want to use an input element, but a text area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.27,
          "end": 88.9,
          "en": "so that the user has a multi line input field available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.9,
          "end": 92.63,
          "en": "which makes entering longer texts more convenient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.63,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "So here, I'll set the id to description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 99.13,
          "en": "and therefore also set the for attribute on the label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.13,
          "end": 100.143,
          "en": "to description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.03,
          "end": 103.93,
          "en": "set the name to description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.93,
          "end": 108,
          "en": "and set the rows attribute here to three,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108,
          "end": 110.82300000000001,
          "en": "to define how big this text area will be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.37,
          "end": 114.94,
          "en": "Now I'll copy the first div again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.94,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "because now I want an input again for the link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 121.61,
          "en": "So here I'll set the for attribute to link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.61,
          "end": 126.16,
          "en": "the id to link, the name to link, and the type to URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.16,
          "end": 129.86,
          "en": "which is one of the native HTML input elements types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.86,
          "end": 132.793,
          "en": "helping us with entering a URL here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 136.54,
          "en": "And now last but not the least, one other div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.54,
          "end": 139.42000000000002,
          "en": "And in that div we want to have the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.42000000000002,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "for submitting this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 146.21,
          "en": "So I'll add the base button, set the type to submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.38,
          "end": 148.9,
          "en": "and also give it a caption, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.9,
          "end": 151.76,
          "en": "which will be Add Resource.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.76,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "One short note about the type on the base button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 156.86,
          "en": "I added this type prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.86,
          "end": 160.64,
          "en": "and I forwarded to the regular type attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.64,
          "end": 161.71,
          "en": "on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 161.71,
          "end": 165.41,
          "en": "I did mention this fall through behavior earlier though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.41,
          "end": 168.1,
          "en": "and therefore we could actually also remove that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.1,
          "end": 170.14,
          "en": "and remove this prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.14,
          "end": 172.01,
          "en": "and therefore just use the props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.01,
          "end": 174.51,
          "en": "which we really added on our own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.51,
          "end": 177.99,
          "en": "And it would still work because this type,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 177.99,
          "end": 180.05,
          "en": "which I'm setting here on the base button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.05,
          "end": 185.05,
          "en": "will automatically fall through to the root HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.17,
          "end": 187.07,
          "en": "inside of the base button template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.07,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "which is this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.46,
          "end": 190.463,
          "en": "That's just another note on that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 191.56,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "With that, I have to submit button in place though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 196.66,
          "en": "and now I want to add some styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.66,
          "end": 199.4,
          "en": "which I, of course, prepared in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.4,
          "end": 203.14,
          "en": "So I'll add some scoped style slots here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.14,
          "end": 207.56,
          "en": "And attached you find, Add Resource CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.56,
          "end": 211.26,
          "en": "As always, copy the CSS roots you'll find in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 211.26,
          "end": 215.3,
          "en": "into this style tag in the addresource.view file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.3,
          "end": 219.023,
          "en": "And this will give us some nice styling for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.11,
          "end": 223.17000000000002,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.17000000000002,
          "end": 225.23,
          "en": "So if we save this now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.23,
          "end": 227.76,
          "en": "we should see this form on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.76,
          "end": 230.8,
          "en": "Not too bad, but of course, it's not doing anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.8,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "And we want to ensure that the user is able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 234.76,
          "en": "to click this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.76,
          "end": 237.67000000000002,
          "en": "We then collect all the user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.67000000000002,
          "end": 241.8,
          "en": "and then we add a new resource based on that input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.8,
          "end": 246.62,
          "en": "Now as before, definitely feel free to try this on your own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.62,
          "end": 249.38,
          "en": "We'll implement it together, step by step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.38,
          "end": 250.523,
          "en": "in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
